                <head>No. 668.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-29"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 29,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Minister, Port
                        au Prince:</hi></p>
                <p>Protest instantly against action of Haytian authorities. Man-of-war ordered.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
